{"id":"efb148810ec0ea9ff19224b1a1b26da37a6a38bc","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1233419","title":"算了一笔账， AI 中转站有那么赚钱吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"bitkuang","excerpt":"问与答 - @bitkuang - 在推广节点看到一堆发赛博鸡蛋的中转好奇进去看了下几个站，充值 ¥1 = $1 ，最离谱的分组倍率还能做到 0.1x按这个计算，最划算的 ChatGPT Pro 20x 一个月保守算 8","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>在推广节点看到一堆发赛博鸡蛋的中转</p>\n<p>好奇进去看了下几个站，充值 ¥1 = $1 ，最离谱的分组倍率还能做到 0.1x</p>\n<p>按这个计算，最划算的 ChatGPT Pro 20x 一个月保守算 8000 刀，如果排除掺水或者日抛、bug team 啥的，这价格不是做慈善吗？</p>\n<p>于是找 AI 计算了一下：</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>汇率按 6.85 算</h2>\n<h2>三档账号保本倍率，按不同地价区开的 Pro</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>套餐</th>\n<th>月成本</th>\n<th>月额度</th>\n<th>保本倍率</th>\n<th>是否盈利</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Plus</td>\n<td>20 刀</td>\n<td>400 刀</td>\n<td>0.3425</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pro(玻区)</td>\n<td>125 刀</td>\n<td>8,000 刀</td>\n<td>0.107</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pro(正价)</td>\n<td>200 刀</td>\n<td>8,000 刀</td>\n<td>0.17125</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table><hr>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/中转站\"><li></li> 中转站</a><a href=\"/tag/盈利\"><li></li> 盈利</a></P><p><span>44 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-11 18:19:29 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959399\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/047ba2809c4f9973c9973a1d9a45eb2b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"karmada\" data-uid=\"468483\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/karmada\">karmada</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 09:24:22 +08:00\">13h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>肯定是各种 bug 号和试用号组的号池</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959438\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4ec7/2727/199115_normal.png?m=1769231137\" alt=\"jamme\" data-uid=\"199115\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jamme\">jamme</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 09:29:02 +08:00\">12h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>“如果排除掺水或者日抛、bug team 啥的”，不太可能排除，隔壁这几天因为中转站掺水一直在吵。然后还有一些是极低倍率吸引你进去，但是低倍率分组不一定能用，或者是打野过来给你体验的，不保证连通性，想稳定就用高倍率分组。另外，你忽略了重置，相比于个人，中转站才是最赚的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959458\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b8ce/9f31/585950_normal.png?m=1745484378\" alt=\"jonty\" data-uid=\"585950\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jonty\">jonty</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 09:31:31 +08:00\">12h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你要是按正价去开，那肯定不盈利。他们都是一些 bug 号、试用号、各种黑卡黑冲组成的号池，成本极低</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959563\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cdca/41db/41900_normal.png?m=1711607036\" alt=\"icanfork\" data-uid=\"41900\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/icanfork\">icanfork</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 09:45:23 +08:00\">12h 43m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>所以我们普通人家小孩长大做生意就是你现在的思维，老老实实做生意肯定血亏的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959620\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cf67a8561d8388e297860e5693c5d2e0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"70nY\" data-uid=\"304475\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/70nY\">70nY</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 09:53:17 +08:00\">12h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>都是日抛和 bug team 的，现在账号都是月限能把额度全登完就算赚，有些都是小时抛，我这里有个中转站只接上游，有些能做到 0.05 倍太离谱了 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/49LA3T6.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/49LA3T6.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959647\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f3b2f96fa827429547bbb2e5a84e11c9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"PerFectTime\" data-uid=\"245182\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/PerFectTime\">PerFectTime</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 09:55:35 +08:00\">12h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>中转可不是靠这个赚钱的，赚的就是用工具注入偷 key 的钱</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959830\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b786/faa6/19094_normal.png?m=1782796942\" alt=\"xAI\" data-uid=\"19094\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xAI\">xAI</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:14:49 +08:00\">12h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不能排除</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959861\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f949/9a12/55844_normal.png?m=1754882647\" alt=\"cielpy\" data-uid=\"55844\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/cielpy\">cielpy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:16:53 +08:00\">12h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>保本率是咋算的？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17959887\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/536d/a34c/516759_normal.png?m=1606181680\" alt=\"TomatoCLI\" data-uid=\"516759\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/TomatoCLI\">TomatoCLI</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:19:04 +08:00\">12h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>中转站的号才几毛钱一个，谁开中转按你这种正价开，那纯纯撒钱的。。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960015\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/17d3/d5c9/71891_normal.png?m=1752241801\" alt=\"106npo\" data-uid=\"71891\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/106npo\">106npo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:30:35 +08:00\">11h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>掺水就别想了,gpt 比水还便宜,拿啥掺 😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960034\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/67d2/e663/180956_normal.png?m=1467980880\" alt=\"ajaxfunction\" data-uid=\"180956\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ajaxfunction\">ajaxfunction</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:32:19 +08:00\">11h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>前几天官方服务器都故障了，中转站还用的飞起。这意味着什么，你不理解吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960045\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a376/5b0b/836721_normal.png?m=1786261950\" alt=\"john1024\" data-uid=\"836721\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/john1024\">john1024</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:33:09 +08:00\">11h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一方面，最近疯狂重置，成本就很低嘛。另一方面，你找的这些中转站，说白了，可能没几个正经的。<br>大量中转站，他的号不是正经的号，黑卡还有一些 bug 号。还有一些低倍率组拿大量免费号当号池的，你问两句，他就报一些错，因为免费号额度不够要换号了。<br>然后就是还有掺假的，拿便宜国产模型掺的。有拿豆包掺的，加点提示词，让它自称是 GPT 。之前 ChatGPT 故障，不是有一堆中转站回复我是豆包。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960201\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9974/b71e/636002_normal.png?m=1695695488\" alt=\"hookbreak\" data-uid=\"636002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hookbreak\">hookbreak</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 10:50:25 +08:00\">11h 38m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>上次 Codex 服务器挂了，好多中转站是的 GPT 模型是正常运行的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960285\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/384578544d759b5d4eae42fa11aaab7f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"niubilewodev\" data-uid=\"362044\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/niubilewodev\">niubilewodev</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 11:00:48 +08:00\">11h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>就是 openai 活动多+风控松，所以现在中转站还能用低倍率。</p><p>你再看看 Claude 模型在中转站价格。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960411\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bcef/8289/707254_normal.png?m=1786412674\" alt=\"NightsReimu\" data-uid=\"707254\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/NightsReimu\">NightsReimu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 11:15:47 +08:00\">11h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我感觉还有就是 claude 是不是他们用了被封号了还能退款，相当于没有模型成本</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960457\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/266c45ffd42b4b256a34461299dc017e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Plutooo\" data-uid=\"631520\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Plutooo\">Plutooo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 11:21:06 +08:00\">11h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>因为排除不了 [掺水或者日抛、bug team 啥的] </p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960466\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/04c7/f37f/12555_normal.png?m=1749107530\" alt=\"x86\" data-uid=\"12555\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/x86\">x86</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-11 11:22:59 +08:00\">11h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>中转的话按量计费你有没有考虑过呢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17960468\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6bb5/3d38/220502_normal.png?m=1766411363\" alt=\"0x0x\" data-uid=\"220502\"></td>\n                <td><